    "designDecisionSummary": "源力设计系统 (Volcengine Yuanli Design System) — B2B enterprise admin design system. Primary color #1664FF (源力蓝). 4px grid base. 32px control height. 48px nav height. Light mode only. 32 components with preview HTML templates. Game feel is layered ON TOP of Volcengine tokens: dark gradient HUD bar uses --foundation-inverse-surface, XP/level progress bars use --color-primary, achievement badges use --color-warning/success, battle feedback uses --color-success/--color-danger. All structural components (TopNav, Sidenav, PageHeader, Table, Button, Tabs, Progress, Badge) come from Volcengine preview templates. Game atmosphere is achieved through layout composition, dark HUD, gradient accents, and RPG terminology — NOT through breaking the token system.",
